{"page":67,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:133","surah":3,"ayah":133,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَسَارِعُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ مَغْفِرَةٍ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ وَجَنَّةٍ عَرْضُهَا ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتُ وَٱلْأَرْضُ أُعِدَّتْ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Hurry towards your Lord’s forgiveness and a Garden as wide as the heavens and earth prepared for the righteous,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَسَارِعُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And hasten","transliteration":"wasāriʿū","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَغْفِرَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"forgiveness","transliteration":"maghfiratin","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَّبِّكُمْ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbikum","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَجَنَّةٍ","en_gloss":"and a Garden ","transliteration":"wajannatin","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَرْضُهَا","en_gloss":"its width","transliteration":"ʿarḍuhā","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتُ","en_gloss":"(is like that of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwātu","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضُ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍu","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أُعِدَّتْ","en_gloss":"prepared","transliteration":"uʿiddat","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_gloss":"for the pious","transliteration":"lil'muttaqīna","verse_key":"3:133"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٣٣","en_gloss":"(133)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:133"}]},{"verse_key":"3:134","surah":3,"ayah":134,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُنفِقُونَ فِى ٱلسَّرَّآءِ وَٱلضَّرَّآءِ وَٱلْكَـٰظِمِينَ ٱلْغَيْظَ وَٱلْعَافِينَ عَنِ ٱلنَّاسِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"who give, both in prosperity and adversity, who restrain their anger and pardon people- God loves those who do good-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","ver