oss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"3:135"},{"pos":24,"ar":"١٣٥","en_gloss":"(135)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:135"}]},{"verse_key":"3:136","surah":3,"ayah":136,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ جَزَآؤُهُم مَّغْفِرَةٌ مِّن رَّبِّهِمْ وَجَنَّـٰتٌ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۚ وَنِعْمَ أَجْرُ ٱلْعَـٰمِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The reward for such people is forgiveness from their Lord, and Gardens graced with flowing streams, where they will remain. How excellent is the reward of those who labour!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those ","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَزَآؤُهُم","en_gloss":"their reward","transliteration":"jazāuhum","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) forgiveness","transliteration":"maghfiratun","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَّبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَجَنَّـٰتٌۭ","en_gloss":"and Gardens","transliteration":"wajannātun","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"flows","transliteration":"tajrī","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَحْتِهَا","en_gloss":"underneath it","transliteration":"taḥtihā","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","en_gloss":"the rivers","transliteration":"l-anhāru","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"abiding forever","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِيهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَنِعْمَ","en_gloss":"And an excellent","transliteration":"waniʿ'ma","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَجْرُ","en_gloss":"reward","transliteration":"ajru","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰمِلِينَ","en_gloss":"(for) the (righteous) workers","transliteration":"l-ʿāmilīna","verse_key":"3:136"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٣٦","en_gloss":"(136)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:136"}]},{"verse_key":"3:137","surah":3,"ayah":137,"ar_uthmani":"قَدْ خَلَتْ مِن قَبْلِكُمْ سُنَنٌ فَسِيرُوا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ فَٱنظُرُوا۟ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God’s ways have operated before your time: travel through the land, and see what was the end of those who disbelieved.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Verily","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَتْ","en_gloss":"passed","transliteration":"khalat","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَبْلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablikum","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سُنَنٌۭ","en_gloss":"situations","transliteration":"sunanun","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَسِيرُوا۟","en_gloss":"then travel","transliteration":"fasīrū","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَٱنظُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and see","transliteration":"fa-unẓurū","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) end","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the deniers","transliteration":"l-mukadhibīna","verse_key":"3:137"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٣٧","en_gloss":"(137)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:137"}]},{"verse_key":"3:138","surah":3,"ayah":138,"ar_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا بَيَانٌ لِّلنَّاسِ وَهُدًى وَمَوْعِظَةٌ لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is a clear lesson to people, and guidance and