40","surah":3,"ayah":140,"ar_uthmani":"إِن يَمْسَسْكُمْ قَرْحٌ فَقَدْ مَسَّ ٱلْقَوْمَ قَرْحٌ مِّثْلُهُۥ ۚ وَتِلْكَ ٱلْأَيَّامُ نُدَاوِلُهَا بَيْنَ ٱلنَّاسِ وَلِيَعْلَمَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَيَتَّخِذَ مِنكُمْ شُهَدَآءَ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"if you have suffered a blow, they too have suffered one like it. We deal out such days among people in turn, for God to find out who truly believes, for Him to choose martyrs from among you- God does not love evildoers-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَمْسَسْكُمْ","en_gloss":"touched you","transliteration":"yamsaskum","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَرْحٌۭ","en_gloss":"a wound","transliteration":"qarḥun","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"so certainly","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَسَّ","en_gloss":"(has) touched","transliteration":"massa","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawma","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَرْحٌۭ","en_gloss":"wound","transliteration":"qarḥun","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّثْلُهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"like it","transliteration":"mith'luhu","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَتِلْكَ","en_gloss":"And this","transliteration":"watil'ka","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَيَّامُ","en_gloss":"[the] days","transliteration":"l-ayāmu","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نُدَاوِلُهَا","en_gloss":"We alternate them","transliteration":"nudāwiluhā","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلِيَعْلَمَ","en_gloss":"[and] so that makes evident","transliteration":"waliyaʿlama","verse_key":"3:140"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:1